@namespace SaveNEIN.Client.Components

    <!-- Native dialog provides modal focus handling and Escape-to-close. -->
    <dialog id="methodology-modal" aria-labelledby="methodology-title" aria-describedby="methodology-intro"
            class="m-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-3xl max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 p-0 text-slate-200 shadow-2xl backdrop:bg-black/80"
            onclick="if(event.target === this) closeMethodologyModal()">
        <header class="sticky top-0 z-10 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 px-6 py-4">
            <h2 id="methodology-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-white">How this calculator works</h2>
            <button type="button" onclick="closeMethodologyModal()" aria-label="Close methodology"
                    class="rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-400">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
            </button>
        </header>
        <div class="space-y-7 p-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
            <p id="methodology-intro">This is an adjustable scenario calculator. It shows what follows from your chosen revenue, population, exposure and cost assumptions. Its outputs are conditional estimates, not predictions of what a casino will cause.</p>
            <section aria-labelledby="methodology-inputs">
                <h3 id="methodology-inputs" class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">What you provide</h3>
                <p>Select a location and impact zones, then choose annual adjusted gross gaming revenue (AGR). AGR is the casino revenue assumption, not total wagers and not a forecast produced by this calculator. Consultant benchmarks are starting scenarios, not validation of these results.</p>
                <p class="mt-3">The map uses census-derived population and geographic data supplied by the site. Its exposure denominator is adults aged 18+, not a count of legally eligible casino customers. Optional population projections compound the selected annual growth rate; they are assumptions rather than official local forecasts.</p>
            </section>
            <section aria-labelledby="methodology-harm">
                <h3 id="methodology-harm" class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">How social costs are estimated</h3>
                <p>Adult population is allocated to the selected radius or drive-time bands. The calculator applies baseline prevalence, proximity multipliers of 2.0, 1.5 and 1.0, and your background increase. The incremental rate is the amount above baseline plus that background increase; it is not the full post-exposure prevalence.</p>
                <p class="mt-3">Estimated additional cases are multiplied by the editable per-person cost assumptions for health, crime, social services, civil legal costs, employment and abused dollars. Defaults retain the legacy Grinols-based valuations; they are not measured Northeast Indiana costs. Rounding and geographic approximation affect totals. Neighboring-county costs are limited to the selected same-state footprint.</p>
                <p class="mt-3">Research on proximity motivates exploring exposure. It does not establish that these exact multipliers, background increases, or time bands are causal estimates for a proposed site. The calculator does not resolve overlap among cost categories, and its labels do not establish that every cost would be paid by government.</p>
            </section>
            <section aria-labelledby="methodology-sales">
                <h3 id="methodology-sales" class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">What the adjustable $243 coefficient means</h3>
                <p>The default comes from Grinols’s <em>Gambling in America</em> (2004), chapter 4, p. 77: a historical Illinois estimate of displaced sales among businesses 10–30 miles from casinos. It is a research reference, not a universal coefficient or a local calibration.</p>
                <p class="mt-3 rounded-lg border border-amber-700/50 bg-slate-950 p-4 font-mono text-sm">Displaced sales = annual AGR × selected dollars per $1,000 ÷ 1,000</p>
                <p class="mt-3">At $100 million AGR and $243 per $1,000, the scenario is $24.3 million in displaced business sales. Change the coefficient under Economic Inputs, or choose $0 to exclude it. The editing bounds are not a statistical confidence interval.</p>
                <p class="mt-3">Sales are turnover, not profit, tax revenue or net social welfare. No visitor-share adjustment, county allocation or 10–30-mile sales map is estimated. The consolidated view shows the sales scenario once and an additional illustrative balance; potential overlap with other cost assumptions is not quantified.</p>
            </section>
            <section aria-labelledby="methodology-statements">
                <h3 id="methodology-statements" class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">How to read the statements and charts</h3>
                <p>Gaming taxes follow the calculator’s configured Indiana schedule and tax-allocation scenario, with incorporated-place containment used for the municipal branch. A preset is not confirmation that a proposal qualifies for that legal treatment.</p>
                <p class="mt-3">The host and regional views compare their assigned tax receipts with modeled social costs. The consolidated view first shows tax receipts less social costs, then separately subtracts the sales-displacement scenario. These are not government budgets, audited financial statements, or complete social cost-benefit accounts. A negative balance does not directly measure a funding requirement.</p>
                <p class="mt-3">The AGR sensitivity curve applies an assumed nonlinear social-cost response. Displaced sales change linearly with AGR in the consolidated series. Neither the curve nor a crossing provides a calibrated break-even target, probability or confidence interval.</p>
            </section>
            <section aria-labelledby="methodology-exclusions">
                <h3 id="methodology-exclusions" class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">What this model does not establish</h3>
                <p>It does not independently forecast casino revenue, patron origins, tourism, competitor losses, induced jobs, wages, net value added, economic multipliers, displaced-business tax losses or the overall welfare effect of a casino. It does not prove that a particular proposal will cause the displayed harm or benefit. Changing assumptions changes the scenario, not the quality of the underlying evidence.</p>
            </section>
            <section aria-labelledby="methodology-references">
                <h3 id="methodology-references" class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">Research and data references</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-sm">
                    <li><a class="text-blue-300 underline" href="https://walkerd.people.charleston.edu/360/BookChapters/Grinols4.pdf#page=23" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Grinols (2004), chapter 4, p. 77</a>: reference for the $243 sales scenario; study context differs from this proposal.</li>
                    <li><a class="text-blue-300 underline" href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26615561/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Welte et al. (2016), distance from gambling venues</a>: evidence of association, not validation of this calculator’s exact exposure rules.</li>
                    <li><a class="text-blue-300 underline" href="https://www.senate.ga.gov/committees/Documents/HiddenCostsofGam.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Legacy Grinols social-cost reference</a>: background for the inherited, editable monetary assumptions.</li>
                    <li><a class="text-blue-300 underline" href="https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/decennial-census/about/rdo/summary-files.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. Census population data</a> and TIGER/Line geography: source data are estimates or historical counts, not individual gambling behavior.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
        </div>
    </dialog>

    <!-- Sources Modal -->
    <div id="sources-modal"
        class="fixed inset-0 z-[1000] bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center p-4"
        onclick="if(event.target === this) closeSourcesModal()">
        <div
            class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl max-w-6xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain shadow-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 relative">

            <!-- Header -->
            <div
                class="sticky top-0 bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-900/95 backdrop-blur-md px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between z-10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500">campaign</span>
                    Casino Proponents Critique
                </h3>
                <button onclick="closeSourcesModal()"
                    class="p-2 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-full transition-colors">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500">close</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Content -->
            <div class="p-8 space-y-10 text-black dark:text-white text-lg leading-relaxed">

                <div class="border-l-8 border-blue-600 dark:border-blue-500 pl-6 bg-transparent">
                    <p class="font-bold italic text-black dark:text-white text-xl leading-tight">
                        "The words you see on these reels aren't random. They are a direct comparison between the
                        marketing promises being sold to Northeast Indiana and the documented reality of casino impacts."
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-yellow-900/20 p-6 border-l-8 border-yellow-500">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-4 text-xl uppercase tracking-wider">Why This
                        Matters</h4>
                    <p class="text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-black dark:text-white">
                        The "Near Miss" effect on this machine—where you see "JOBS" just one click away from
                        "ADDICTION"—mirrors the deceptive nature of FWFirst's marketing campaign. We are being sold the
                        <em>possibility</em> of prosperity while the <em>probability</em> points to social cost.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-6 items-start">
                    <!-- Row 1: Headers -->
                    <h4
                        class="text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">verified</span>
                        The Pitch (Bait)
                    </h4>
                    <h4
                        class="text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">warning</span>
                        The Reality (Hook)
                    </h4>

                    <!-- Row 2: Descriptions -->
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <p class="text-lg">
                            Phrases taken directly from <strong><a href="https://fwfirst.com/" target="_blank"
                                    class="underline hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">FWFirst's</a></strong>
                            marketing materials and press releases.
                        </p>
                        <span class="block text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                            Note: Since the website's content may change, SaveNEIN has <a
                                href="https://web.archive.org/web/20251224153405/https://fwfirst.com/" target="_blank"
                                class="underline hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">archived a copy of FWFirst's
                                website</a> as of December 24, 2025.
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-lg">
                        Outcomes cited in independent studies, opposition testimony, and crime statistics from similar
                        markets.
                    </p>

                    <!-- Row 3: Lists -->
                    <ul id="bait-list" class="space-y-3">
                        <!-- Populated by JS -->
                    </ul>
                    <ul id="hook-list" class="space-y-3">
                        <!-- Populated by JS -->
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Mini Modal for Word Details -->
            <div id="word-detail-modal"
                class="absolute inset-0 z-[150] opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8"
                onclick="if(event.target === this) closeWordModal()">

                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full shadow-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 relative transform transition-transform scale-95 z-10 overflow-hidden"
                    id="word-modal-content">

                    <!-- Close Button -->
                    <button onclick="closeWordModal()"
                        class="absolute top-4 right-4 p-2 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-full transition-colors z-30">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500">close</span>
                    </button>

                    <div class="flex items-stretch min-h-[300px]">
                        <!-- Left Arrow -->
                        <AppButton onclick="prevWord()" Icon="arrow_back_ios_new" Class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white m-4 shadow-lg">
                            <span class="hidden sm:inline">Previous</span>
                        </AppButton>

                        <!-- Main Content -->
                        <div class="flex-1 p-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
                            <h3 id="word-modal-title"
                                class="text-2xl font-black text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">
                            </h3>
                            <p id="word-modal-desc"
                                class="text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed"></p>
                            <div>
                                <a id="word-modal-link" href="#" target="_blank"
                                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-500 font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-wider">
                                    <span>View Source</span>
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">open_in_new</span>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Right Arrow -->
                        <AppButton onclick="nextWord()" Class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white m-4 shadow-lg flex-row-reverse">
                            <span class="hidden sm:inline">Next</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward_ios</span>
                        </AppButton>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Scenario Simulator Modal -->
    <div id="simulator-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[1000] hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300"
        aria-labelledby="modal-title" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
        <!-- Backdrop -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity"
            onclick="closeSimulatorModal()"></div>

        <div class="fixed inset-0 z-10 overflow-y-auto">
            <div class="flex min-h-full items-center justify-center p-4 text-center sm:p-0">
                <div
                    class="relative transform overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-left shadow-2xl transition-all sm:my-8 sm:w-full sm:max-w-4xl">

                    <!-- Header -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/50 px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-700">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2" id="modal-title">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-blue-500">science</span>
                                Economic Impact Simulator
                            </h3>
                            <button onclick="closeSimulatorModal()"
                                class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Segmented Progress Bar -->
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 w-full mt-6">
                            <!-- Step 1 Indicator -->
                            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 group cursor-pointer" onclick="goToSimStep(1)">
                                <div id="sim-bar-1"
                                    class="h-1.5 w-full bg-emerald-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(16,185,129,0.5)]">
                                </div>
                                <span id="sim-label-1"
                                    class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors duration-300">Revenue</span>
                            </div>
                            <!-- Step 2 Indicator -->
                            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 group cursor-pointer" onclick="goToSimStep(2)">
                                <div id="sim-bar-2"
                                    class="h-1.5 w-full bg-slate-700 rounded-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
                                <span id="sim-label-2"
                                    class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors duration-300">Allocation</span>
                            </div>
                            <!-- Step 3 Indicator -->
                            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 group cursor-pointer" onclick="goToSimStep(3)">
                                <div id="sim-bar-3"
                                    class="h-1.5 w-full bg-slate-700 rounded-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
                                <span id="sim-label-3"
                                    class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors duration-300">Social
                                    Costs</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Content -->
                    <div class="px-6 py-6 h-[500px] flex flex-col overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">

                        <!-- Step 1: Revenue Scenario -->
                        <div id="sim-step-1"
                            class="sim-step w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-start transition-all duration-300">
                            <label class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3">1.
                                Select Adjusted Gross Revenue (AGR) Scenario</label>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
                                <!-- $43M -->
                                <label class="cursor-pointer group relative">
                                    <input type="radio" name="sim-agr" value="43" class="peer sr-only">
                                    <div
                                        class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-700/50 border-2 border-slate-600 peer-checked:border-emerald-500 peer-checked:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-all hover:bg-slate-700 h-full flex flex-col">
                                        <div class="text-lg font-black text-white mb-1">$43 MM</div>
                                        <div class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-tight">Spectrum Gaming (With Tribal
                                            Competition)</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div
                                        class="absolute top-2 right-2 opacity-0 peer-checked:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
                                        <span
                                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-500 text-lg">check_circle</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>

                                <!-- $112M (Default) -->
                                <label class="cursor-pointer group relative">
                                    <input type="radio" name="sim-agr" value="112" class="peer sr-only" checked>
                                    <div
                                        class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-700/50 border-2 border-slate-600 peer-checked:border-emerald-500 peer-checked:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-all hover:bg-slate-700 h-full flex flex-col">
                                        <div class="text-lg font-black text-white mb-1">$112 MM</div>
                                        <div class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-tight">Spectrum Gaming (Primary
                                            Projection)</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div
                                        class="absolute top-2 right-2 opacity-0 peer-checked:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
                                        <span
                                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-500 text-lg">check_circle</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>

                                <!-- $204M -->
                                <label class="cursor-pointer group relative">
                                    <input type="radio" name="sim-agr" value="204" class="peer sr-only">
                                    <div
                                        class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-700/50 border-2 border-slate-600 peer-checked:border-emerald-500 peer-checked:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-all hover:bg-slate-700 h-full flex flex-col">
                                        <div class="text-lg font-black text-white mb-1">$204 MM</div>
                                        <div class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-tight">Spectrum Gaming (No Tribal
                                            Competition)</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div
                                        class="absolute top-2 right-2 opacity-0 peer-checked:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
                                        <span
                                            class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-500 text-lg">check_circle</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>

                                <!-- $330M -->
                                <label class="cursor-pointer group relative">
                                    <input type="radio" name="sim-agr" value="330" class="peer sr-only">
                                    <div
                                        class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-700/50 border-2 border-slate-600 peer-checked:border-blue-500 peer-checked:bg-blue-500/10 transition-all hover:bg-slate-700 h-full flex flex-col">
                                        <div class="text-lg font-black text-white mb-1">$330 MM</div>
                                        <div class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-tight">Union Gaming (FWFirst Sales
                                            Pitch)</div>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Custom Option -->
                            <div class="relative flex py-10 items-center">
                                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-700"></div>
                                <span
                                    class="flex-shrink-0 mx-4 text-slate-500 text-sm uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">Or
                                    Enter Custom</span>
                                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-700"></div>
                            </div>

                            <label
                                class="cursor-pointer group relative flex items-center p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-700/30 border-2 border-slate-600 peer-checked:border-emerald-500 peer-checked:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-all hover:bg-slate-700/50">
                                <input type="radio" name="sim-agr" value="custom" class="peer sr-only"
                                    onchange="document.getElementById('sim-custom-agr').focus()">

                                <!-- Visible Radio (Icon Swap) -->
                                <span
                                    class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 text-2xl mr-4 peer-checked:hidden transition-colors">radio_button_unchecked</span>
                                <span
                                    class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-500 text-2xl mr-4 hidden peer-checked:block transition-colors">check_circle</span>

                                <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4">
                                    <div class="flex-1">
                                        <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Custom AGR Projection</div>
                                        <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">Enter a specific Adjusted Gross Revenue
                                            figure ($MM).</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="relative w-full sm:w-48">
                                        <div
                                            class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3 flex items-center pointer-events-none">
                                            <span class="text-slate-400 font-bold">$</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <input type="number" id="sim-custom-agr" min="0" max="1000" placeholder="112"
                                            class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-600 text-white rounded-lg py-2 pl-8 pr-12 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all font-mono font-bold text-right"
                                            oninput="document.querySelector('input[name=sim-agr][value=custom]').checked = true">
                                        <div
                                            class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 pr-3 flex items-center pointer-events-none">
                                            <span class="text-slate-500 font-bold text-sm">MM</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </label>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Step 2: Enacted Tax Allocation -->
                        <div id="sim-step-2"
                            class="sim-step w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-start hidden transition-all duration-300">
                            <label class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3">2. Tax
                                Allocation Scenario</label>

                            <div class="rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-500/50 bg-purple-900/10 p-5">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-purple-400 text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">account_balance</span>
                                    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                                        <div class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300">Active Scenario</div>
                                        <div id="sim-allocation-scenario-name" class="mt-1 text-xl font-black text-white">NE Indiana Casino (HB 1038)</div>
                                        <p id="sim-allocation-scenario-summary" class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
                                            The selected casino location determines which host-government branch applies. The simulator keeps the active tax scenario instead of applying a separate humanitarian split.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div id="sim-hb1038-allocation" class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                                <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-600 bg-slate-700/30 p-4">
                                    <div class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-300">Regular Wagering Tax</div>
                                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
                                        <p><strong class="text-white">Municipal site:</strong> 75% state / 25% host municipality</p>
                                        <p><strong class="text-white">Unincorporated fallback:</strong> 75% state / 25% host county</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-600 bg-slate-700/30 p-4">
                                    <div class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-300">Supplemental Wagering Tax (3.5% AGR)</div>
                                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
                                        <p><strong class="text-white">Municipal site:</strong> 45% city / 45% county / 10% NE Indiana RDA</p>
                                        <p><strong class="text-white">Modeled unincorporated fallback:</strong> 90% county / 10% NE Indiana RDA</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div id="sim-custom-allocation-note" class="hidden mt-5 rounded-xl border border-blue-500/40 bg-blue-500/10 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-100">
                                The active Custom scenario will be used. Its municipal or fallback branch is selected automatically from the casino's mapped location.
                            </div>

                            <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
                                To inspect or edit every branch percentage, close this quick-start form and use the Tax Allocation Scenario controls under Economic Inputs.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Step 3: Social Cost Sensitivity -->
                        <div id="sim-step-3"
                            class="sim-step w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-start hidden transition-all duration-300">
                            <label class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3">3.
                                Social Cost Sensitivity</label>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                                <label class="flex items-center p-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-600 bg-slate-700/30 hover:bg-slate-700/50 has-[:checked]:border-red-500/70 has-[:checked]:bg-red-900/10 focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-red-400 cursor-pointer transition-colors">
                                    <input type="radio" name="sim-cost" value="0.8" class="peer sr-only">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 text-xl peer-checked:hidden" aria-hidden="true">radio_button_unchecked</span>
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined hidden text-red-500 text-xl peer-checked:block" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
                                    <div class="ml-3">
                                        <span class="block text-sm font-bold text-white">Conservative</span>
                                        <span class="block text-sm text-slate-400">-20% to Baseline</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                                <label class="flex items-center p-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-600 bg-slate-700/30 hover:bg-slate-700/50 has-[:checked]:border-red-500/70 has-[:checked]:bg-red-900/10 focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-red-400 cursor-pointer transition-colors">
                                    <input type="radio" name="sim-cost" value="1.0" class="peer sr-only" checked>
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 text-xl peer-checked:hidden" aria-hidden="true">radio_button_unchecked</span>
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined hidden text-red-500 text-xl peer-checked:block" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
                                    <div class="ml-3">
                                        <span class="block text-sm font-bold text-white">Standard Baseline</span>
                                        <span class="block text-sm text-slate-400">Inflation-Adjusted Grinols</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                                <label class="flex items-center p-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-600 bg-slate-700/30 hover:bg-slate-700/50 has-[:checked]:border-red-500/70 has-[:checked]:bg-red-900/10 focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-red-400 cursor-pointer transition-colors">
                                    <input type="radio" name="sim-cost" value="1.2" class="peer sr-only">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 text-xl peer-checked:hidden" aria-hidden="true">radio_button_unchecked</span>
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined hidden text-red-500 text-xl peer-checked:block" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
                                    <div class="ml-3">
                                        <span class="block text-sm font-bold text-white">Aggressive</span>
                                        <span class="block text-sm text-slate-400">+20% to Baseline</span>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Custom Option -->
                            <div class="relative flex py-10 items-center">
                                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-700"></div>
                                <span
                                    class="flex-shrink-0 mx-4 text-slate-500 text-sm uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">Or
                                    Enter Custom</span>
                                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-slate-700"></div>
                            </div>

                            <label
                                class="cursor-pointer group relative flex flex-col p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-700/30 border-2 border-slate-600 peer-checked:border-blue-500 peer-checked:bg-blue-500/10 transition-all hover:bg-slate-700/50">

                                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                                    <input type="radio" name="sim-cost" value="custom" class="peer sr-only"
                                        id="sim-cost-custom-radio">

                                    <!-- Visible Radio (Icon Swap) -->
                                    <span
                                        class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 text-2xl shrink-0 peer-checked:hidden transition-colors">radio_button_unchecked</span>
                                    <span
                                        class="material-symbols-outlined text-red-500 text-2xl shrink-0 hidden peer-checked:block transition-colors">check_circle</span>

                                    <div class="flex-1">
                                        <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Custom Adjustment</div>
                                        <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">Apply a percentage increase or decrease to
                                            the baseline costs.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-600/50">
                                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-center">

                                        <!-- Direction Toggle -->
                                        <div class="flex bg-slate-900 rounded-lg p-1 border border-slate-700">
                                            <label class="cursor-pointer">
                                                <input type="radio" name="sim-cost-dir" value="-1" class="peer sr-only"
                                                    onchange="updateCustomCostDisplay()">
                                                <div
                                                    class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-bold text-slate-400 bg-transparent peer-checked:bg-red-600 peer-checked:text-white peer-checked:shadow-inner transition-all">
                                                    Decrease</div>
                                            </label>
                                            <label class="cursor-pointer">
                                                <input type="radio" name="sim-cost-dir" value="1" class="peer sr-only"
                                                    checked onchange="updateCustomCostDisplay()">
                                                <div
                                                    class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-bold text-slate-400 bg-transparent peer-checked:bg-emerald-600 peer-checked:text-white peer-checked:shadow-inner transition-all">
                                                    Increase</div>
                                            </label>
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- Percentage Input -->
                                        <div class="relative w-32">
                                            <input type="number" id="sim-custom-pct" min="0" max="500" placeholder="20"
                                                class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 text-white rounded-lg py-2 pl-4 pr-8 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all font-mono font-bold text-right"
                                                oninput="document.getElementById('sim-cost-custom-radio').checked = true; updateCustomCostDisplay()">
                                            <div
                                                class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 pr-3 flex items-center pointer-events-none">
                                                <span class="text-slate-500 font-bold text-sm">%</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- Result Display -->
                                        <div
                                            class="flex-1 text-right sm:text-left sm:pl-4 border-t sm:border-t-0 sm:border-l border-slate-700 pt-4 sm:pt-0">
                                            <div
                                                class="text-sm uppercase font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider mb-1">
                                                Resulting Multiplier</div>
                                            <div class="text-xl font-mono font-black text-white" id="sim-custom-result">
                                                1.00x</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/50 px-6 py-4 border-t border-slate-700 flex justify-between items-center">
                        <div>
                            <button id="sim-btn-cancel" onclick="closeSimulatorModal()"
                                class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-red-600 text-white font-bold hover:bg-red-500 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-red-500/20 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" aria-hidden="true">close</span> Cancel
                            </button>
                            <button id="sim-btn-back" onclick="prevSimStep()"
                                class="hidden px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-red-600 text-white font-bold hover:bg-red-500 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-red-500/20 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span> Back
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex gap-3">
                            <button id="sim-btn-next" onclick="nextSimStep()"
                                class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                                Next <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
                            </button>
                            <button id="sim-btn-run" onclick="runSimulation()"
                                class="hidden px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 text-white font-bold hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-cyan-400 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">play_arrow</span> Run Simulation
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

